{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T18:54:18",
      "utterance": "こんにちは。本日はよろしくお願いいたします。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T18:54:46",
      "utterance": "こちらこそ宜しくお願い致します",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T18:54:48",
      "utterance": "時間になりましたら、はじめさせていただきます。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T18:55:03",
      "utterance": "はい、お願い致します。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:00:44",
      "utterance": "こんにちは。相談員です。本日はご相談にお越しいただきありがとうございます。 差し支えなければ、はじめにご年齢と性別を教えていただけますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:01:14",
      "utterance": "13才、女",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:01:42",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。今日はどのようなご相談ですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:02:10",
      "utterance": "同じ部活の先輩を好きになってます",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:02:45",
      "utterance": "LINEでやり取りしてますが",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:02:45",
      "utterance": "ええ、そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:03:01",
      "utterance": "ええ(聞いていますね)",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:03:18",
      "utterance": "この間は彼女いますかって聞いたら",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:03:33",
      "utterance": "うんうん",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:03:48",
      "utterance": "仲良くなった人にしか教えないんだって言われました",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:04:16",
      "utterance": "これってどういう意味なんだろうなと思いまして",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:04:43",
      "utterance": "ええ…教えてもらえなかったんですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:04:51",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:05:29",
      "utterance": "私のこと本当はどう思っているんだろう？考えちゃいます",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:05:57",
      "utterance": "ええ。何で教えてくれなかったのかな、と疑問に思いますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:06:13",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:06:56",
      "utterance": "その言葉を聞いたときは、どんな思いが頭に浮かんできましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:07:45",
      "utterance": "えっ仲良くなった人にしか教えないって何なんだろう？って思いました",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:08:08",
      "utterance": "私はまだ仲良くないっていうこと？かなって",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:08:39",
      "utterance": "うんうん。そう思うのも無理はないと思いますよ。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:08:59",
      "utterance": "モヤモヤを感じますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:09:00",
      "utterance": "本当は彼女いるんでしょうか",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:09:14",
      "utterance": "モヤモヤします",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:09:42",
      "utterance": "どう思いますか？",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:09:58",
      "utterance": "私は彼女がいるかはまだ判断できかねると思います。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:10:15",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:11:13",
      "utterance": "では、あなたの力になりたいので、お話を聞かせてくださいね。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:11:31",
      "utterance": "はい、お願いします",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:11:53",
      "utterance": "はい。かしこまりました。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:13:16",
      "utterance": "その先輩は彼女さんがいる、というお話は聞いたことはありましたか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:13:47",
      "utterance": "女子の先輩にきいてみたのですが",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:14:04",
      "utterance": "はい(聞いています)",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:14:40",
      "utterance": "いないと思うよと言ってました。好きって言ってる人聞いたこと無いって言ってました",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:15:17",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:15:46",
      "utterance": "その言葉を聞いて、どう思いましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:16:04",
      "utterance": "えっそうなんだ、",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:16:20",
      "utterance": "あんなにかっこいいのに",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:16:39",
      "utterance": "いないはずがないって思いました",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:17:01",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。いないはずがない、と感じたのですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:17:09",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:18:06",
      "utterance": "ちなみに、その先輩は「仲良くなった人にしか教えないんだ」と言ってましたが、",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:18:27",
      "utterance": "その後は先輩とどうお話しましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:19:35",
      "utterance": "そうなんですかって思って、それ以上聞けなくなって他の話になりました",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:21:06",
      "utterance": "なるほど、そうだったんですね。でも、質問しづらかったですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:21:27",
      "utterance": "はい、聞けなかったです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:22:58",
      "utterance": "そうですよね。「彼女いますか？」と聞いたとき、先輩の様子はどうでしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:23:23",
      "utterance": "何か様子に変化はなかったですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:24:05",
      "utterance": "それは…みたいな感じで",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:24:22",
      "utterance": "仲良くなった人にしか教えないって",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:24:31",
      "utterance": "かえってきて",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:25:07",
      "utterance": "うんうん、",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:25:23",
      "utterance": "いつも私の方から話かけてないと話してくれないので",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:25:46",
      "utterance": "はい(聞いていますね)",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:26:01",
      "utterance": "本当は私のことどう思ってるんだろうって",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:26:26",
      "utterance": "遊びではぐらかしてるだけなのでしょうか",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:27:18",
      "utterance": "ただ教えたくないのか、何か気持ちを隠しているのか、色々考えられそうですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:27:44",
      "utterance": "そうなんです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:28:31",
      "utterance": "話の途中ですが、あなたのことを何とお呼びしたらいいですか？",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:28:40",
      "utterance": "ニックネームでも構いません。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:28:46",
      "utterance": "さおり　です",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:29:08",
      "utterance": "さおりさんですね、ありがとうございます。",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:29:38",
      "utterance": "さおりさんは、今回一番相談したい点はどんなことになりますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:30:28",
      "utterance": "LINEでやり取りして話はするけど",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:30:39",
      "utterance": "うんうん、",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:30:51",
      "utterance": "そうやって彼女のこととか聞くと",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:31:11",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:31:13",
      "utterance": "教えてくれない感じなので",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:31:52",
      "utterance": "本当はどう思ってるんだろう？って思っちゃいます",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:32:16",
      "utterance": "相談員さんはどう思いますか？",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:32:57",
      "utterance": "そうですよね、先輩の気持ちが分かりにくいですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:33:05",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:33:52",
      "utterance": "私はいないのに何回もはぐらかすかな？と思いました。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:34:14",
      "utterance": "はい、そうなんですか",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:34:16",
      "utterance": "何回も隠すのが不自然に感じます。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:35:02",
      "utterance": "ということは、いるっていうことでしょうか",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:35:13",
      "utterance": "ただ、先輩の気持ちの本当のところがまだ分からないので、一緒に考えていきましょうね。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:35:43",
      "utterance": "はい、やっぱりいるのかな…",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:36:02",
      "utterance": "どうでしょう？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:36:27",
      "utterance": "証拠がないので、まだ分からないです。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:36:45",
      "utterance": "たしかにそうですね",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:37:15",
      "utterance": "でもいずれにせよ、「先輩の気持ちが知りたい」ですよね。気持ちさえ分かれば、スッキリしますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:37:24",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:38:10",
      "utterance": "ちなみに、LINEのやりとりは、どのくらい続いていますか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:38:29",
      "utterance": "1ヶ月くらいです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:39:11",
      "utterance": "そうだったんですね。先輩の様子はどうですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:39:56",
      "utterance": "様子というより、LINEのやりとりの雰囲気です。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:40:20",
      "utterance": "様子はあまり変わらないですが、いつも私の方から連絡しないとむこうから連絡はくれません",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:40:46",
      "utterance": "雰囲気ですか",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:41:05",
      "utterance": "うんうん(聞いていますね)",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:41:33",
      "utterance": "最初よりは少しずつ色々話すようなにはなっかなって",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:41:56",
      "utterance": "部活も一緒ですし、塾の話とか",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:42:14",
      "utterance": "私から色々聞いたりしますね",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:42:32",
      "utterance": "うんうん、少しずつ距離が近づいている証拠のように感じますね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:42:46",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:43:24",
      "utterance": "でも、先輩から話かけてくれないのは、少し不安に感じませんか？",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:43:37",
      "utterance": "はい、そうなんです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:44:35",
      "utterance": "そうですよね。「聞いてくれないのは興味ないのかな」と不安を感じるのも無理はないと思います。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:45:10",
      "utterance": "ただ、全員がそういうわけではないと思います。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:45:43",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-05-28T19:46:17",
      "utterance": "中には「ただ、何を話したらいいか」と考えすぎちゃう人もいますからね。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
